# The companion workflow is a SEPARATE marketplace listing
# (ray9/odoo-quote-to-cash-airlock). Shipping it inside the module bundle
# bloats the download and makes the signature churn whenever the workflow
# changes, for no benefit to a buyer of the module.
workflow/

# Listing copy — belongs to the marketplace record (passed via
# --description at publish time), not to the code buyers install.
LISTING.md
